### Page 1 of 4

```text
Honorable Mayor Patrick Collins
Page 1 of 1
January 17, 2024

X:\Department Folders\Projects\Dell Range_Vanburen Improvements\Contracts\AVI\Dell Range ( Approx. Van Buren to Whitney)\7728_Mod #1\Agenda Memo.docx

MEMO

TO:

Honorable Mayor Patrick Collins, City of Cheyenne

City Council Members

FROM:
Cassie L. Pickett, PE, Engineering Manager

DATE:
January 17, 2024

SUBJECT:
Contract Modification #1 between AVI pc and the City of Cheyenne for

Contract #7728 Dell Range Design Services

Purpose of Project:
Design for the reconstruction of a portion of Dell Range (between Van Buren Ave. and Whitney Rd.).
The purpose and need resulting from Cheyenne’s development and growth to the east, as well as the
existing demand on Dell Range Blvd.

Reason for Contract Modification:
Unforeseen design elements were discovered during the plan development as outlined below:
• Design of sanitary sewer to the west of Green Prairie to James Street to accommodate
future development.
• Extending the water main from Holgerson to the East to accommodate the Meadowlark
Development
• Design of interim detention facility and swale on Whitney Ranch property.
• Provided exhibits for construction and drainage easements on Dell Range properties.
• Additional work coordinating the centerline location of Dell Range with the section line
and tying into Tri-hydro’s alignment.
• Additional requests by BOPU on watermain on Gysel and El Camino
• Coordination of potholing, surveying and verifying locations of existing utilities along
the corridors (gas, fiber, electric)

Estimated Cost:
The contract will increase requested is $38,515.00 for a total contract amount of $82,915.00.   The
funding source for the project will be from the Dell Range Project associated with GL#020-26-2616-
42-43422.
The Engineer’s Department has reviewed the request and respectfully recommends approval of the
requested modification.

CITY ENGINEER’S OFFICE
2101 O’Neil Avenue
Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001
```

