### Page 4 of 4

```text
January 9, 2024
Tom Cobb, PE City Engineer
City of Cheyenne Engineering Department
2101 O’Neil Ave
Cheyenne, WY  82001

RE: Dell Range – VanBuren Improvements
                              City Contract No. 7728 Dell Range Design Services - $44,400

Dear Mr. Cobb,

For the additional work directed by the City, AVI respectfully requests a change order in the amount of
$38,515 to cover the cost of the design work. The additional fees are for the following tasks:
•
Design of sanitary sewer to the west of Green Prairie to James Street to accommodate
future development.
•
Extending the water main from Holgerson to the East to accommodate the Meadowlark
Development
•
Design of interim detention facility and swale on Whitney Ranch property.
•
Provided exhibits for construction and drainage easements on Dell Range properties.
•
Additional work coordinating the centerline location of Dell Range with the section line and
tying into Tri-hydro’s alignment.
•
Additional requests by BOPU on watermain on Gysel and El Camino
•
Coordination of potholing, surveying and verifying locations of existing utilities along the
corridors (gas, fiber, elec)
We wanted to keep the project moving forward and without delays so we did not ask for a change order
when these items occurred.  We would be more than happy to discuss in more detail at your convenience.

Respectfully Submitted
AVI PROFESSIONAL CORPORATION

Christine R. Johnson, PE
